<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oregon Metal cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oregon Metal cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Oregon Metallurgical Corp to near-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- said the long-term rating remained accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Oregon Metallurgical lost 4-3/8 to 21-3/4.</p>
</text>
